<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>In Loving Memory of Evelyn Carter</title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="style.css">
</head>
<body>

<header>
    <h1>In Loving Memory</h1>
</header>

<main class="memorial">

    <img src="portrait.jpg" alt="Portrait of Evelyn Carter" class="portrait">

    <h2>Evelyn Carter</h2>

    <p class="dates">
        April 12, 1997 – October 28, 2025
    </p>

    <p>
        Evelyn was a beloved daughter, friend, and photographer whose kindness
        touched everyone she met. She found beauty in forgotten places and
        believed every story deserved to be remembered.
    </p>

    <blockquote>
        "The stars don't disappear. They just become harder to see."
    </blockquote>

    <section>
        <h3>Remembering Evelyn</h3>

        <p>
            We invite family and friends to share memories, photographs,
            and messages celebrating her life.
        </p>
    </section>

    <footer>
        <p>Forever in our hearts.</p>
    </footer>

</main>

<!--
Some memories refuse to stay buried.
-->

</body>
</html>
